<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Meeting Action Item Extractor</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #f1f5f9;
